asic level, you can <strong>accelerate those glute gains</strong>, but other improvements to focus and energy may help women dealing with hormonal shifts and facing broader fatigue.<br><br>Creatine also <strong>helps with muscle recovery and has huge benefits for bone density and joint health</strong> - women naturally have lower bone density than men, so paying extra attention to this area is important at all stages of life.<br><br>Taking creatine at levels under 10g per day also carries<strong> little to no risk of bloating - get that energy and those gains without feeling puffy!</strong></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="09730921-f9d9-4f59-8970-eb856afe4df7" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-rc3asx"><div class="r-1fa1c89"><video style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:var(--rof, inherit);object-position:var(--rop, inherit)" preload="metadata" autoplay="" muted="" loop=""></video></div></div></div><div data-rid="bb16ecde-a537-4620-8d25-6eaa9be443d3" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="benefits" tabindex="-1" id="benefits" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-n5zu4p"><picture data-rid="6671af0c-7a5a-45c9-9449-ce7e74aa69e8" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-n9brvs"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_ProvenResultsWithConsistency_WhiteBG_Compressed_8deebae9-05a4-4221-8db7-ccdd8081e745.png?v=1740955454&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_ProvenResultsWithConsistency_WhiteBG_Compressed_8deebae9-05a4-4221-8db7-ccdd8081e745.png?v=1740955454&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/9204/4732/files/Infographic_ProvenResultsWithConsistency_WhiteBG_Compressed_8deebae9-05a4-4221-8db7-ccdd8081e745.png?v=1740955454&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https